  "description": "\"Sleep with me, sir.\"\n\nIt was the last night we would never see again. Ahead of her arranged marriage, she had to put an end to her long unrequited love.\n\n\"I'm willing to go that far.\" \n\nAfter this night, all emotions are cut off, Moon Jeong-hoo of Moo-sung Motors and his secretary Yoon Hee-jae. It seemed like I could go back to normal.\n\n\"I know. That it would be comfortable for both of us if nothing had happened. But... that doesn't work. Do it one more time, us. Just like Secretary Yoon wanted that night.”\n\nBut the moment I slept with him the second time, it was really irreversible. \n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5631756), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8592925)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9155432)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9155423)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR15: [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003012)",
